WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.672
A small piece of a company.

2
00:00:01.792 --> 00:00:03.766
A stock represents ownership.

3
00:00:03.886 --> 00:00:06.219
One share is one unit of that ownership.

4
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.074
Cash becomes shares.

5
00:00:08.194 --> 00:00:13.685
Buy 2 shares at $100 each: spend $200 in cash and own 2 shares.

6
00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:15.369
Value can rise.

7
00:00:15.489 --> 00:00:20.900
If each share reaches $110, 2 shares are worth $220.

8
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.539
That is a $20 unrealized gain.

9
00:00:24.059 --> 00:00:25.081
Value can fall.

10
00:00:25.201 --> 00:00:30.066
If each share falls to $90, 2 shares are worth $180.

11
00:00:30.186 --> 00:00:32.775
That is a $20 unrealized loss.

12
00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:34.679
Practice the idea.

13
00:00:34.799 --> 00:00:36.610
Use virtual cash in Sprout.

14
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.261
A real stock never guarantees a profit.

